      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this only callable by ResourceCache? I think given how coupled Resource and ResourceCache are, I could see making them friends so we can define public API that any part of graphite or clients can use, the interaction API between Resource and Cache, and the internal API of each. Those 3 groups seem like useful boundaries to enforce.",
